.TH PERFECTSENSE 1 "2026-05-08" "PerfectSense 0.0.10" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
perfectsense \- one-shot CLI for Acer Predator PerfectSense sysfs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perfectsense
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B perfectsense
reads and writes PerfectSense sysfs attributes via
.BR libperfectsense (3).
It does
.B not
require
.BR perfectsensed (8)
for get/set operations.
.PP
The kernel module
.B perfectsense.ko
must be loaded and must own the Acer gaming WMI path (unload conflicting
drivers such as out-of-tree gaming WMI modules first).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON for commands that support it (notably
.BR status ).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Print thermal profile, AC, fans, battery/misc, RGB/logo summary.
.TP
.B temps
Print CPU/GPU temperatures in °C (from PerfectSense hwmon).
.TP
.B gpu powerd get|on|off
Query or force
.B nvidia\-powerd
(Dynamic Boost). Normally driven by
.B mode set
(off for eco/quiet; on for balanced+).
.TP
.BI "mode get" \fR "|" " mode set " name
Get or set the firmware thermal profile (also syncs
.B nvidia\-powerd
on Helios).
Names:
.BR low\-power ,
.BR quiet ,
.BR balanced ,
.BR balanced\-performance ,
.BR performance .
Aliases:
.BR eco ,
.BR turbo ,
.BR bp .
.TP
.BI "fan get" \fR "|" " fan set " "cpu gpu" \fR "|" " fan auto"
Read live duty or set target duties (percent), or return fans to firmware auto.
.TP
.BI "fan aggressor on" \fR "|" " off" \fR "|" " status" \fR "|" " set " key=val…
Enable/disable FanAggressor offset mode or edit config
.RB ( engage_c ,
offsets, floors, …). Persists under
.I /etc/perfectsense/
when writable.
.TP
.BI "rgb effect get" \fR "|" " set " csv
Four-zone keyboard effect mode (sysfs
.BR four_zone_mode ).
.TP
.BI "event inject " name
Synthetic hotkey/AC event for testing
.RB ( turbo ,
.BR mode ,
.BR ac\-online ,
.BR ac\-offline ).
.TP
.B battery \fR...
80% charge limiter and calibration helpers.
.TP
.B usb \fR... / \fBlcd \fR... / \fBkb\-timeout \fR... / \fBboot\-sound \fR...
Misc GUID attributes exposed by the module.
.TP
.B rgb \fR... / \fBlogo \fR... / \fBlights reset
Four-zone keyboard and lid logo lighting.
.TP
.B cpu \fR...
Userspace CPU power (governor, EPP, turbo, RAPL) and named presets.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_SYSFS
Override path to the
.B perfect_sense
sysfs group.
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_KB_SYSFS
Override four-zone keyboard sysfs group.
.TP
.B PERFECTSENSE_LOGO_SYSFS
Override lid logo sysfs group.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /sys/devices/platform/perfectsense/perfect_sense/
Primary ABI (
.BR api_version
and attributes).
.TP
.I /run/perfectsense/fan\-aggressor.conf
FanAggressor runtime config (when used with the daemon).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR perfectsensed (8),
.BR busctl (1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yPerfectBR/PerfectSense
